### 5.2 Agent配置
```java
// 创建带工具的Agent
AiService weatherAgent = AiServices.builder(ChatLanguageModel.class)
.chatLanguageModel(OpenAiChatModel.builder()
.apiKey(System.getenv("OPENAI_API_KEY"))
.modelName("gpt-4o")
.build())
.tools(new WeatherTools())
.build();
// 使用
String response = weatherAgent.chat("北京今天天气怎么样？");
System.out.println(response);
